<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 30-0 IN SECOND INNINGS AT TEA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 30-0 IN SECOND INNINGS AT TEA.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa were 30 without loss in their second innings at tea on the fourth day of the first test against Australia at the Wanderers on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: South Africa 302 and 30-0, Australia 628-8 declared (Greg Blewett 214, Steve Waugh 160, Matthew Elliott 85).</p>
